978 - Assassination of King Edward the Martyr at Corfe Castle 1584 - Death of Ivan the Terrible of Russia 1834 - The Tolpuddle Martyrs sentenced to transportation 1871 - Communard uprising in Paris 1922 - Mahatma Gandhi sentenced to six years' imprisonment 1935 - 30-mph speed limit introduced in Britain in built-up areas 1949 - Establishment of NATO 1965 - First space walk (by cosmonaut Colonel Alexei Leonov) 1967 - Grounding of the oil tanker Torrey Canyon off Land's End 1978 - Former Italian prime minister Aldo Morro kidnapped
